{title: We Wish You a Merry Christmas}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
We [Eb]wish you a Merry [Ab]Christmas
We [F]wish you a Merry [Bb]Christmas
We [G7]wish you a Merry [Cm]Christmas
And a [Ab]Happy [Bb]New [Eb]Year!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Good [Eb]tidings we [Bb]bring to [Cm]you and your [Bb]kin.
We [Eb]wish you a merry [Gm]Christmas
And a [Ab]Happy [Bb]New [Eb]Year!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Oh, [Eb]bring us some figgy [Ab]pudding
Oh, [F]bring us some figgy [Bb]pudding
Oh, [G7]bring us some figgy [Cm]pudding
And [Ab]bring it [Bb]right [Eb]here!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Good [Eb]tidings we [Bb]bring to [Cm]you and your [Bb]kin.
We [Eb]wish you a merry [Gm]Christmas
And a [Ab]Happy [Bb]New [Eb]Year!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
We [Eb]won’t go until we [Ab]get some
We [F]won’t go until we [Bb]get some
We [G7]won’t go until we [Cm]get some
So [Ab]bring it [Bb]right [Eb]here!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Good [Eb]tidings we [Bb]bring to [Cm]you and your [Bb]kin.
We [Eb]wish you a merry [Gm]Christmas
And a [Ab]Happy [Bb]New [Eb]Year!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
We [Eb]all like our figgy [Ab]pudding
We [F]all like our figgy [Bb]pudding
We [G7]all like our figgy [Cm]pudding
With [Ab]all its [Bb]good [Eb]cheer!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Good [Eb]tidings we [Bb]bring to [Cm]you and your [Bb]kin
We [Eb]wish you a merry [Gm]Christmas
And a [Ab]Happy [Bb]New [Eb]Year!
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
We [Eb]wish you a Merry [Ab]Christmas
We [F]wish you a Merry [Bb]Christmas
We [G7]wish you a Merry [Cm]Christmas
And a [Ab]Happy [Bb]New [Eb]Year!
{end_of_verse}
